-- title:
--   Physical original strict-interior mixed Levy mesh energy from genuine stopping clocks
-- statement:
--   Source-specific energy estimate on the exact original ruin/horizon/upcrossing clipped finite-activity mixed Levy grid. All strictly interior cells have physical source bounds by B72. Measurability of both square-source and square-duration sums follows from actual 𝓕.rightCont stopping-time grid endpoints and original joint path measurability (B74). B70 supplies duration-integrability and B73 gives the compact jump-cell finite expected energy independent of grid cardinality. Retains explicit physical Gaussian no-contact energy and jump-count domination assumptions. The genuine terminal ruin-crossing negative jump is excluded, as it can be unbounded and belongs to the nonlinear terminal generator/overshoot account.
-- source:
--   Avram Palmowski Pistorius 2007 Proposition 4(i), original source B72/B73/B74; no surrogate process or post-ruin extension.

